.TH CHMODDER.SH 1 "2026-04-25" "GitMirror" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
chmodder.sh \- set executable permission on all .sh files in current directory
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bash chmodder.sh
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B chmodder.sh
iterates over all files matching
.B *.sh
in the current working directory and runs
.B chmod +x
on each regular file.
.PP
The script prints one status line per file changed.
.SH OPTIONS
This command has no options.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 on success. Exits non-zero if an unexpected error occurs.
.SH EXAMPLES
Set executable permission on all shell scripts in the current directory:
.PP
.B bash chmodder.sh
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR chmod (1)
